  "body": "Front Home: 4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage | Private Balcony | 1 Off-Street Carpark\r\nRear Homes: 4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage | Private Deck | 1 Off-Street Carpark\r\n\r\nWelcome to 57 Oaktree Avenue – a boutique development of four brand-new homes in a highly sought-after Browns Bay location.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern family living, these homes combine contemporary style, quality finishes, and practical layouts. Whether you’re purchasing your first home, upgrading for more space, or looking for an investment opportunity, these residences offer comfort, convenience, and easy low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nThe front home enjoys excellent street appeal and features a private balcony, while the rear homes offer private decks – ideal spaces for relaxing or entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the outstanding school zoning, including Sherwood School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate, Long Bay College, and Rangitoto College, with a range of early childhood centres and kindergartens also nearby.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of Browns Bay Beach, local cafés, restaurants, parks, and Browns Bay Village all within easy reach. Westfield Albany is just a short drive away, while excellent transport links provide convenient access across the North Shore and into Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nOffering all the benefits of a brand-new build – modern design, quality construction, and low-maintenance living – these homes present an excellent opportunity in one of the North Shore’s most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nTitle and CCC have now been issued, giving buyers added certainty and making these brand-new homes ready for their new owners.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or visit one of our upcoming Open Homes.",
